{"id":"2.5.2.5","doc":"T","title":"JUMPR – Jump to a Relative Address (Conditional upon R0)","words":121,"blocks":[{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_5-12.png","alt":"Figure 2.5-12. Instruction Type - JUMPR"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.5-12):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Threshold"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Threshold value for condition (see "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Cond"}]},{"t":"text","v":" below) to jump"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Cond"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Condition to jump: 0 - jump if R0 < "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Threshold"}]},{"t":"text","v":"; 1 - jump if R0 > "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Threshold"}]},{"t":"text","v":"; 2 - jump if R0 = "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Threshold"}]}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Step"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Relative shift from current position, expressed in "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" words: if Step[7] = 0, then PC = PC + Step[6:0]; if Step[7] = 1, then PC = PC - Step[6:0]"}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note: All jump addresses are expressed in "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" words."}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Description: The instruction executes a jump to a relative address, if the condition is true."}]},{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The condition is the result of comparing the R0 register value and the "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Threshold"}]},{"t":"text","v":" value."}]}]}]}